  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NHC Ukraine: Strengthening Democracy Through Civil Society</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ukraine: Strengthening Democracy Through Civil Society&quot; aims to strengthen Ukrainian democracy by building the organisational capacity of CSOs.

Objectives: To enhance the organisational capacity of CSOs; and to enhance the capacity of CSOs to engage in advocacy and policy formulation for and oversight of democratic governance reforms.

The project consists of grants to newly emerging initiatives and to established CSOs. It will also conduct capacity-building training, collaborative events, and advocacy campaigns.

This project supports SDG5 by supporting gender-equality projects through sub-granting, gender-focused training, and initiatives for the empowerment of women and SDG16 by supporting anti-corruption, human rights, and inclusive participation initiatives.

Expected outcomes: The organisational capacity of Ukrainian CSOs is enhanced, and the capacity of CSOs to engage in advocacy and policy formulation for and monitoring of democratic governance reforms is enhanced.</narrative>
  </description>
